coming forward.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7703328060906244093/comments/default/5910690090257855717'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7703328060906244093/comments/default/5910690090257855717'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/06/derek-hales-murderer-is-back-on-streets.html?showComment=1338505989958#c5910690090257855717' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/06/derek-hales-murderer-is-back-on-streets.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7703328060906244093' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7703328060906244093' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-848642884"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 31, 2012 at 5:13 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3005630935840229527</id><published>2010-05-05T00:44:37.662-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-05T00:44:37.662-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I am a combat veteran, a Marine Sergeant at that. ...</title><content type='html'>I am a combat veteran, a Marine Sergeant at that. This Marine can survive a foreign war and honorable years of service, however he cant survive a trigger happy, incompetent, under-trained waste of a life with a badge looking for a reason to use his firearm. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I will politely state this officer is damn lucky to not live near me. You want to kill off combat vets, good, you can fight for your own rights. Pray we never meet, civilian.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http